# Tracking-era tarihsel sezonlar (2013-14+) — zengin percentile skorlama ile
# geri-doldurulmuş sezonlar, get_historical() bunları öncelikli okur (bkz.
# api/main.py _load_scores_for_season). 2026-07: prototip (2023-24, 2024-25)
# onaylandı, kalan 10 sezona (2013-14–2022-23) genişletildi — tracking
# verisinin NBA'de var olduğu TÜM sezonlar artık zengin yoldan geçiyor.
!data/2024-25__player_scores.parquet
!data/2023-24__player_scores.parquet
!data/2022-23__player_scores.parquet
!data/2021-22__player_scores.parquet
!data/2020-21__player_scores.parquet
!data/2019-20__player_scores.parquet
!data/2018-19__player_scores.parquet
!data/2017-18__player_scores.parquet
!data/2016-17__player_scores.parquet
!data/2015-16__player_scores.parquet
!data/2014-15__player_scores.parquet
!data/2013-14__player_scores.parquet

